{"type":"text","timestamp":1794049841144,"sessionID":"ses_e4a523d64ffeZWJGrl6IZk2wti","part":{"id":"prt_1b5b40d140010UT8QpLc1bztSH","messageID":"msg_1b5b30063001GApKdYsWz3bkK8","sessionID":"ses_e4a523d64ffeZWJGrl6IZk2wti","type":"text","text":"\n\nOne of my \"fixed\" cases is still malformed: `parse('a,\"x\"\"', '\"y\"\\n')` concatenates to `a,\"x\"\"\"y\"\\n`, where the 3rd quote closes the field and `y` is garbage. For `x\"\"y` we need 4 quotes between `x` and `y`:\n\n","time":{"start":1794049838356,"end":1794049841142}}}
